### Recommendations (from live Azure metrics)
Derived from VM CPU and storage utilization, written to `azure-cockpit-recommendations` (same concept as GCP/AWS cockpit recommendation indices).

| Category | Meaning |
| --- | --- |
| **cost_optimization** | Underutilized VMs (avg CPU &lt; 5% / 24h) or near-empty storage |
| **performance_risk** | Hot VMs (avg CPU &gt; 85%) |

